# Nexus SP1 Forge G2 hygiene (P1-WAVE-07, per SP1 05C §11 / W05D Decision 6)
# Generated artifacts never land. Root .gitignore for the Forge (DevTools) repo.

# .NET / VS build debris
bin/
obj/
.vs/
publish/

# DevBridge runtime/selftest scratch
logs/
*.user

# Worktree admin (governed worktrees live under here; keep the container out of
# status noise without touching the worktrees themselves)
.forge/

# DevBridge scratch/temp and rolling workbook backups (regenerated, not source)
DevBridge/temp/
DevBridge/state/backups/
